{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24272","headline":"五月斋戒罢宴彻乐闻韦宾客皇甫郎中饮会亦稀又知欲携酒馔出斋先以长句呈谢 · 白居易","name":"五月斋戒罢宴彻乐闻韦宾客皇甫郎中饮会亦稀又知欲携酒馔出斋先以长句呈谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妓房匣镜满红埃，酒库封瓶生绿苔。\n居士尔时缘护戒，车公何事亦停杯。\n散斋香火今朝散，开素盘筵後日开。\n随意往还君莫怪，坐禅僧去饮徒来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}